<title>UK: Base metals end sluggish LME mostly lower.</title>
<headline>Base metals end sluggish LME mostly lower.</headline>
<text>
<p>COPPER - Ends slightly lower, manages to hold near $2,400. Spreads stay tight.</p>
<p>ALUMINIUM - Extends break under $1,600, ends lower.</p>
<p>NICKEL - Tails back to lower close.</p>
<p>LEAD - Ends easier, off three-month peak.</p>
<p>ZINC - Finishes lower, tracks others.</p>
<p>TIN - Ends stable. ALLOY - Closes quiet.</p>
</text>
